{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Debugging Neural Networks Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "A diagnostic toolkit that monitors activations, gradients, and loss curves. You will deliberately break a network and use the toolkit to diagnose each problem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: The NetworkDebugger Class"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Hooks into a PyTorch model to record activation and gradient statistics per layer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import torch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import torch.nn as nn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import math"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class NetworkDebugger:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, model):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.model = model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.activation_stats = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.gradient_stats = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.loss_history = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.lr_losses = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.hooks = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self._register_hooks()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _register_hooks(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for name, module in self.model.named_modules():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if isinstance(module, (nn.Linear, nn.Conv2d, nn.ReLU, nn.LeakyReLU)):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                hook = module.register_forward_hook(self._make_activation_hook(name))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.hooks.append(hook)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                hook = module.register_full_backward_hook(self._make_gradient_hook(name))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.hooks.append(hook)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _make_activation_hook(self, name):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        def hook(module, input, output):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            with torch.no_grad():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                out = output.detach().float()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.activation_stats[name] = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    \"mean\": out.mean().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    \"std\": out.std().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    \"fraction_zero\": (out == 0).float().mean().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    \"min\": out.min().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    \"max\": out.max().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return hook"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _make_gradient_hook(self, name):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        def hook(module, grad_input, grad_output):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if grad_output[0] is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                with torch.no_grad():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    grad = grad_output[0].detach().float()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    self.gradient_stats[name] = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                        \"mean\": grad.mean().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                        \"std\": grad.std().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                        \"abs_mean\": grad.abs().mean().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                        \"max\": grad.abs().max().item(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return hook"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def record_loss(self, loss_value):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.loss_history.append(loss_value)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def check_loss_health(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(self.loss_history) < 2:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return \"NOT_ENOUGH_DATA\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        recent = self.loss_history[-10:]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if any(math.isnan(v) or math.isinf(v) for v in recent):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return \"NAN_OR_INF\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(self.loss_history) >= 20:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            first_half = sum(self.loss_history[:10]) / 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            second_half = sum(self.loss_history[-10:]) / 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if second_half >= first_half * 0.99:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return \"NOT_DECREASING\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(recent) >= 5:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            diffs = [recent[i+1] - recent[i] for i in range(len(recent)-1)]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if max(diffs) - min(diffs) > 2 * abs(sum(diffs) / len(diffs)):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return \"OSCILLATING\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return \"HEALTHY\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def check_activations(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        issues = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for name, stats in self.activation_stats.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if stats[\"fraction_zero\"] > 0.5:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"DEAD_NEURONS: {name} has {stats['fraction_zero']:.0%} zero activations\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if abs(stats[\"mean\"]) > 10:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"EXPLODING_ACTIVATIONS: {name} mean={stats['mean']:.2f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if stats[\"std\"] < 1e-6:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"COLLAPSED_ACTIVATIONS: {name} std={stats['std']:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return issues if issues else [\"HEALTHY\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def check_gradients(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        issues = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        grad_magnitudes = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for name, stats in self.gradient_stats.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            grad_magnitudes.append((name, stats[\"abs_mean\"]))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if stats[\"abs_mean\"] < 1e-7:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"VANISHING_GRADIENT: {name} abs_mean={stats['abs_mean']:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if stats[\"abs_mean\"] > 100:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"EXPLODING_GRADIENT: {name} abs_mean={stats['abs_mean']:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(grad_magnitudes) >= 2:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            first_mag = grad_magnitudes[0][1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            last_mag = grad_magnitudes[-1][1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if last_mag > 0 and first_mag / last_mag > 100:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                issues.append(f\"GRADIENT_RATIO: first/last = {first_mag/last_mag:.0f}x (vanishing)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return issues if issues else [\"HEALTHY\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def print_report(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"\\n=== NETWORK DEBUGGER REPORT ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"\\nLoss health: {self.check_loss_health()}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if self.loss_history:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  Last 5 losses: {[f'{v:.4f}' for v in self.loss_history[-5:]]}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"\\nActivation diagnostics:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for item in self.check_activations():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  {item}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"\\nGradient diagnostics:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for item in self.check_gradients():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  {item}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"\\nPer-layer activation stats:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for name, stats in self.activation_stats.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  {name}: mean={stats['mean']:.4f} std={stats['std']:.4f} zero={stats['fraction_zero']:.1%}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"\\nPer-layer gradient stats:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for name, stats in self.gradient_stats.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  {name}: abs_mean={stats['abs_mean']:.2e} max={stats['max']:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def remove_hooks(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for hook in self.hooks:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            hook.remove()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.hooks.clear()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: The Overfit-One-Batch Test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def overfit_one_batch(model, x_batch, y_batch, criterion, lr=0.01, steps=200):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=lr)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model.train()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== OVERFIT ONE BATCH TEST ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"Batch size: {x_batch.shape[0]}, Steps: {steps}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for step in range(steps):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        optimizer.zero_grad()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        output = model(x_batch)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss = criterion(output, y_batch)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss.backward()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        optimizer.step()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if step % 50 == 0 or step == steps - 1:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            with torch.no_grad():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                preds = (output > 0).float() if output.shape[-1] == 1 else output.argmax(dim=1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                targets = y_batch if y_batch.dim() == 1 else y_batch.squeeze()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                acc = (preds.squeeze() == targets).float().mean().item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  Step {step:3d} | Loss: {loss.item():.6f} | Accuracy: {acc:.1%}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    final_loss = loss.item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if final_loss > 0.1:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"\\n  FAIL: Loss did not converge ({final_loss:.4f}). Model or training loop is broken.\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return False"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"\\n  PASS: Loss converged to {final_loss:.6f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return True"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Learning Rate Finder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def find_learning_rate(model, x_data, y_data, criterion, start_lr=1e-7, end_lr=10, steps=100):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    import copy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    original_state = copy.deepcopy(model.state_dict())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=start_lr)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    lr_mult = (end_lr / start_lr) ** (1 / steps)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model.train()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    results = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    best_loss = float(\"inf\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    current_lr = start_lr"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== LEARNING RATE FINDER ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for step in range(steps):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        optimizer.zero_grad()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        output = model(x_data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss = criterion(output, y_data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if math.isnan(loss.item()) or loss.item() > best_loss * 10:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        best_loss = min(best_loss, loss.item())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        results.append((current_lr, loss.item()))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss.backward()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        optimizer.step()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        current_lr *= lr_mult"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for param_group in optimizer.param_groups:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            param_group[\"lr\"] = current_lr"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model.load_state_dict(original_state)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if len(results) < 10:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"  Could not complete LR sweep -- loss diverged too quickly\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    min_loss_idx = min(range(len(results)), key=lambda i: results[i][1])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    suggested_lr = results[max(0, min_loss_idx - 10)][0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Swept {len(results)} steps from {start_lr:.0e} to {results[-1][0]:.0e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Minimum loss {results[min_loss_idx][1]:.4f} at lr={results[min_loss_idx][0]:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Suggested learning rate: {suggested_lr:.2e}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Gradient Checker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def _flat_to_multi_index(flat_idx, shape):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    multi_idx = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    remaining = flat_idx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for dim in reversed(shape):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        multi_idx.insert(0, remaining % dim)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        remaining //= dim"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return tuple(multi_idx)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def gradient_check(model, x, y, criterion, eps=1e-4):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model.train()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    x_double = x.double()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    y_double = y.double()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model_double = model.double()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== GRADIENT CHECK ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    overall_max_diff = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    checked = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for name, param in model_double.named_parameters():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not param.requires_grad:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        layer_max_diff = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        model_double.zero_grad()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        output = model_double(x_double)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss = criterion(output, y_double)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        loss.backward()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        analytical_grad = param.grad.clone()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        num_checks = min(5, param.numel())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i in range(num_checks):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            idx = _flat_to_multi_index(i, param.shape)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            original = param.data[idx].item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            param.data[idx] = original + eps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            with torch.no_grad():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                loss_plus = criterion(model_double(x_double), y_double).item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            param.data[idx] = original - eps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            with torch.no_grad():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                loss_minus = criterion(model_double(x_double), y_double).item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            param.data[idx] = original"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            numerical = (loss_plus - loss_minus) / (2 * eps)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            analytical = analytical_grad[idx].item()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            denom = max(abs(numerical), abs(analytical), 1e-8)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            rel_diff = abs(numerical - analytical) / denom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            layer_max_diff = max(layer_max_diff, rel_diff)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            checked += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        overall_max_diff = max(overall_max_diff, layer_max_diff)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        status = \"OK\" if layer_max_diff < 1e-5 else \"MISMATCH\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"  {name}: max_rel_diff={layer_max_diff:.2e} [{status}]\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    model.float()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"\\n  Checked {checked} parameters\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if overall_max_diff < 1e-5:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"  PASS: Gradients match (rel_diff < 1e-5)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    elif overall_max_diff < 1e-3:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"  WARN: Small differences (1e-5 < rel_diff < 1e-3)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(\"  FAIL: Gradient mismatch detected (rel_diff > 1e-3)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return overall_max_diff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
